{
  "date": "2026-10-22",
  "category": "fintech",
  "title_zh": "数字人民币全面升级，进入\"2.0时代\"",
  "title_en": "China's digital yuan gets a full upgrade, entering its \"2.0 era\"",
  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "zh": "10月21日，在北京举行的2026金融街论坛上，中国人民银行副行长陆磊宣布，数字人民币的基础设施服务体系完成全面升级。同时，数字人民币运营管理中心发布了两项新成果：央行端的数字人民币系统（DCEPS）和一个智能合约生态服务框架。",
      "en": "On October 21, at the 2026 Financial Street Forum in Beijing, PBOC Deputy Governor Lu Lei announced that the digital yuan's infrastructure service system has completed a full upgrade. The Digital Yuan Operation and Management Center also released two new results: the central-bank-side digital yuan system (DCEPS) and a smart contract ecosystem service framework."
    },
    {
      "zh": "这次升级最重要的变化是，数字人民币从\"现金型1.0\"变成了\"存款货币型2.0\"。简单来说，以前数字人民币更像手机里的现金；现在，用户放在商业银行钱包里的数字人民币，会算作银行存款，记在银行的负债里。这样可以减少人们担心的\"钱离开银行\"的问题。",
      "en": "The most important change is that the digital yuan moves from \"cash-type 1.0\" to \"deposit-money-type 2.0\". Simply put, it used to be more like cash on your phone; now, digital yuan in commercial-bank wallets counts as bank deposits and is recorded as a bank liability. This eases the worry that \"money will leave the banks\"."
    },
    {
      "zh": "新系统把发行、零售、批发、跨境等功能放在同一个平台上，可以7×24小时运行。智能合约是另一个重点：钱可以按照提前写好的规则自动支付，比如货物到了才付款，这对企业和政府补贴等场景很有用。",
      "en": "The new system puts issuance, retail, wholesale, cross-border and other functions on one platform, running 24/7. Smart contracts are another focus: money can be paid automatically by rules written in advance — e.g. pay only after goods arrive — useful for businesses and government subsidies."
    }
  ],
